{"data":[{"author_id":"620632841","created_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114688497508569483"],"id":"2114688497508569483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":10001,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"赵长鹏最有影响力的盟友是两个强大的统治家族。一个是管理阿拉伯联合酋长国的家族，他们希望赵长鹏帮助他们在沙漠中打造一个科技强国。另一个是特朗普家族。去年，币安与世界自由金融公司建立了商业关系，这家加密初创公司由特朗普总统和他的三个儿子创立。世界自由去年为特朗普带来了7.99亿美元——这是","url":"https://x.com/nytchinese/status/2114688497508569483"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114688493070774537"],"id":"2114688493070774537","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":121,"impression_count":120889,"like_count":614,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":31},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113545963935584643","type":"quoted"}],"text":"峰哥发布马驹桥视频当天遇派出所人员上门，直播中断\n\n网友投稿：10月25日，B站UP主“峰哥亡命天涯”发布二十多分钟的马驹桥日结体验视频。当天下午，他在直播时遇到派出所人员上门，随后中断直播。 https://t.co/LHa0DWqtcU https://t.co/8BGuLcE8H3","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114688493070774537"},{"author_id":"168139512","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:58:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114688224488751334"],"id":"2114688224488751334","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2126,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114638501040038013","type":"quoted"}],"text":"https://t.co/tf6d1XBep2 https://t.co/K68w3nv3sL","url":"https://x.com/geekbb/status/2114688224488751334"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:50:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114686005559107779"],"id":"2114686005559107779","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1766,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"张无忌后来基本上人见人爱，\n\n赵敏、周芷若、小昭、殷离个个为他神魂颠倒\n\n那为什么偏偏朱九真看不上他？","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114686005559107779"},{"author_id":"1338075202798809089","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:49:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114685825078428076"],"id":"2114685825078428076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":9480,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114583176991658176","type":"quoted"}],"text":"巴基斯坦沙特土耳其三国军方、国防和情报最高层共赴德黑兰，是近期中东值得重视的新动向。聊聊几点：\n1、这次访问最早是巴基斯坦陆军参谋长穆尼尔（巴基斯坦实际权力掌控者）上周访问德黑兰时提出举行这次四方磋商，伊方同意。 https://t.co/G1ZpujStQd","url":"https://x.com/qinbafrank/status/2114685825078428076"},{"author_id":"8149482","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:48:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114685651043967075"],"id":"2114685651043967075","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":10682,"like_count":63,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":6},"text":"【北京铁杆盟友武契奇败选 塞尔维亚数万人欢呼自由】 \n塞尔维亚前总统武契奇10月25日在议会选举中承认败给学生支持的候选人名单后，数万人涌上首都贝尔格莱德街头，庆祝这场历史性胜利。 美联社指出，武契奇败选将是塞尔维亚政坛的一次大地震。\n详细报道：https://t.co/LFaxvUzqfW https://t.co/700WGE2EwG","url":"https://x.com/VOAChinese/status/2114685651043967075"},{"author_id":"143810986","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:46:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114685207248838949"],"id":"2114685207248838949","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5302,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":2},"text":"塞尔维亚强人领导人武契奇领导的塞尔维亚前进党在议会选举中败给了由大学生推动的\"学生名单\"党。武契奇与中国和俄罗斯都关系密切。他将失利归咎于塞尔维亚独立媒体，以及未点名的欧洲国家和\"美国深层政府\"的干预。 https://t.co/jyINUVkDNu","url":"https://x.com/dw_chinese/status/2114685207248838949"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:42:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114684045418217960"],"id":"2114684045418217960","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1318,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114681307980566841","type":"quoted"}],"text":"我觉得正处实职比较好吧？\n清北就算从政，正处也是一道坎\n\n不一定能到，体制内混到正处实职了\n什么学历也就不重要了 https://t.co/Cr2Okh0tah","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2114684045418217960"},{"author_id":"2786701","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114683650147274880"],"id":"2114683650147274880","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":25037,"like_count":61,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":92,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我觉得，中国应该向越南取取经，同为社会主义国家，越南就能做到不封禁外网，整个社会运行都没什么问题。","url":"https://x.com/williamlong/status/2114683650147274880"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:40:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114683459150938386"],"id":"2114683459150938386","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":34,"impression_count":31145,"like_count":216,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":15,"retweet_count":13},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2079431176364675506","type":"quoted"}],"text":"10月25日，有网友晒出法国Uber Eats 的骑手罢工，他们组织使用多部手机集体拒绝报酬最低的订单，迫使算法提高价格，直到每单配送达到15欧元或更高。\n\n评论区的中国骑手，有的骑手晒出1元单价的配送费，有的骑手晒出了要配送293件麦当劳但配送费只有4.5元的订单。 https://t.co/JjmAiHxaro https://t.co/ixTPXqVcTf","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2114683459150938386"},{"author_id":"1499656309565657089","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:39:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114683374208168000"],"id":"2114683374208168000","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7117,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最近一个月，原油价格小碎步式的蹭蹭往上迈，涨了 20%。布伦特原油 (BZ) 从 $94 到了 $114。\n\n所以原油又成了近期市场的热门交易品种，交易量与持仓都多了不少。布伦特原油 (BZ) 在 CEX 上的持仓额就突破了 $4 亿。\n\n不过跟其它 TradFi 一样，现在交易量/持仓啥的其实都是集中在头部几家。全市场 $4 亿 https://t.co/NKM1UaFzKJ","url":"https://x.com/EmberCN/status/2114683374208168000"},{"author_id":"2786701","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:38:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114682980300136727"],"id":"2114682980300136727","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":7649,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我看很多人说深圳这边不用翻墙就能上外网了，但我测试不行啊？","url":"https://x.com/williamlong/status/2114682980300136727"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-26T11:31:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114681352570224743"],"id":"2114681352570224743","public_